{"articleNo":"323778","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=323778&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 2021 디자인씽킹 교육생 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.09.06","hit":"5443","attachments":[{"name":"디자인씽킹_신청서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=323778&attachNo=104267"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14pt;\">창업원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14pt;\">창업교육센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14pt;\">에서&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 돋움; font-size: 14pt;\">창의적 문제해결 역량강화를 위한</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-family:돋움;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">2021 </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">디자인씽킹 교육</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;mso-hansi-font-family:돋움;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:14.0pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">을 아래와 같이 실시하오니</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">